1
Filter
conjuncts=3
1
8
2
Scan m
Index bound: using m_b; touched=3
1
3

# m_b: index page 1 + two table fetches 2 + storage_row_read 2 + filter 5×2 + assignment 1×2 = 17.
# The former PK bound read all six rows and evaluated the filter six times.
# cost: 17
statement ok
UPDATE m SET x = x + 1 WHERE id > 0 AND b >= 1 AND b <= 2

